    "body": "@bkardell, I'm not the author of the comment you linked to. However, I also presume exactly what you surmised shall, in practice, occur. Enough Electron-based text editors render syntax highlighting in a remarkably lightweight manner for markup supersets like `text/Markdown` (CommonMark) that I would expect some implementers to implement specific syntax highlighting predicated upon the presence of the `type` parameter, which would differ based upon its argument.",
